{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 50, :comments ["<b>But you, appoint the Levites.</b> He explains why they were not mustered, for the charge of the Tabernacle is upon them; therefore they do not go out to the army." "<b>The Tabernacle of the Testimony.</b> It is the Tent of Meeting, and the Tabernacle refers to the Ark, where the Testimony is." "<b>And all its vessels.</b> Such as the Menorah, the Table, and the Altars." "<b>And all that pertains to it.</b> These are the accessories of the vessels." "<b>They shall carry.</b> They alone are the carriers when the camp journeys, and they are the attendants when it camps, and they shall camp around the Tabernacle."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:15:56.102193388Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}